          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Toothpick Digits"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.189,
            0.17,
            0.681,
            0.191
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We can write digits as shown in the image below:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.277,
            0.204,
            0.719,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "0123456789"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.275,
            0.832,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You can either use toothpicks or matchsticks, or just write the digits in this way, using lines to represent sticks. To make the digit 7, three sticks are needed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.189,
            0.33,
            0.829,
            0.35
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Write or make the number 5108. How many sticks are require",
              "styles": [
                "underline"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "d?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.367,
            0.804,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Make or write the number 42,019. It would require exactly 23 sticks."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.41,
            0.804,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Starting with 42,019, add or write two more sticks, and make a bigger number. One example is 42,078. What other numbers bigger than 42,019 can you make in this way?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.471,
            0.804,
            0.529
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Preetham wants to insert the digit ‘1’ somewhere among the digits ‘4’, ‘2’, ‘0’, ‘1’ and ‘9’. Where should he place the digit ‘1’ to get the biggest possible number?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.531,
            0.804,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. What other numbers can he make by placing the digit ‘1’?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.588,
            0.573,
            0.61
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Make or write the number 63,890."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.613,
            0.804,
            0.672
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Starting with 63,890, rearrange exactly four sticks and make a bigger number. One example is 88,078. What other numbers bigger than 63,890 can you make in this way?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.706,
            0.727,
            0.728
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Make any number using exactly 24 sticks or lines."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.731,
            0.804,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. What is the biggest number that can be made using 24 sticks or lines?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.773,
            0.803,
            0.813
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. What is the smallest number that can be made using 24 sticks or lines?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.191,
            0.829,
            0.705,
            0.849
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Make your own questions and challenge each other."
            }
          ],
